Here is a JSON Schema (for validating endpoint/network configuration) and a Python script supporting changeable IP addresses, URLs, and DSN (Data Source Name) options—including CLI flags, environment variable overrides, and optional SHA-256 verification.

1. Configuration JSON Schema (endpoint_dsn_config.schema.json)
